Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.75,0:00:04.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been dull without\Nso many orders lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.92,0:00:08.17,Default,,0,0,0,,We've been too busy up to now.\NIt's like it's been Black Friday.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.17,0:00:10.04,Default,,0,0,0,,We've been working too hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.04,0:00:12.47,Default,,0,0,0,,If we took our case to\Nan animal rights group—
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.47,0:00:16.63,Default,,0,0,0,,or whatever the right outfit is, we might\Nbe able to get fair compensation.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.63,0:00:21.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, you're really starting\Nto sound like a human, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.64,0:00:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to assert our rights, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.14,0:00:28.27,Default,,0,0,0,,These days, cats are creatures\Nthat deserve respect,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.27,0:00:32.53,Default,,0,0,0,,not the property of human beings.\NThat's the trend out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.74,0:00:37.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Cats are cats. I think you're\Noverstating the case.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.95,0:00:42.12,Default,,0,0,0,,However, I do agree with you that\Ncats are deserving of some dignity.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.12,0:00:45.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I wish they would\Ntake a page from us,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.16,0:00:47.46,Default,,0,0,0,,but unlike us furry beasts,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.46,0:00:50.13,Default,,0,0,0,,those hairless, naked\Nanimals are heartless.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.13,0:00:53.67,Default,,0,0,0,,It may not do us any\Ngood to count on them.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.22,0:00:56.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Guys, supper's ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.23,0:01:15.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Sitting under the {\i1}kotatsu {\i0}like this,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.32,0:01:18.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm kind of getting\Na craving for ice cream.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.95,0:01:24.32,Default,,0,0,0,,No! Grandma, you meanie!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.32,0:01:25.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I want ice cream!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.87,0:01:26.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't have any.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.96,0:01:30.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Wah! I hate you!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.30,0:01:38.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Ordinarily, right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.71,0:01:42.01,Default,,0,0,0,,there'd be some boring news on the TV,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.01,0:01:45.35,Default,,0,0,0,,and Mom would be putting\Nher gross cooking on the table.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.35,0:01:49.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Her mom hated us\Nsomething terrible, didn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.65,0:01:52.23,Default,,0,0,0,,She was someone who\Ncouldn't even tell the difference
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.23,0:01:54.98,Default,,0,0,0,,between cat hair and ordinary dust.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.98,0:01:57.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish I could go back home.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.61,0:02:05.24,Default,,0,0,0,,There she goes, wishing\Nfor the impossible again.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.24,0:02:08.37,Default,,0,0,0,,For heaven's sake,\Nshe doesn't understand a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.37,0:02:11.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think so?\NMizuho is 16 years old now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.38,0:02:14.59,Default,,0,0,0,,If she were a cat, it would be crazy\Nif she hadn't had any kittens yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.59,0:02:17.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, aren't you a modern cat?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.26,0:02:19.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Those animal groups would\Nhave something to say about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.59,0:02:20.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, buzz off.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.38,0:02:25.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Mizuho is still a child.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.06,0:02:37.11,Default,,0,0,0,,She couldn't survive without us around.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.95,0:02:40.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, let's have some ice cream.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.12,0:02:44.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll give you this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.70,0:02:48.58,Default,,0,0,0,,No! Not until you get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.46,0:02:52.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What did she want us to bring this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.54,0:02:54.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Ice cream.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.34,0:02:55.34,Default,,0,0,0,,By when?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.34,0:02:56.96,Default,,0,0,0,,She said right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.96,0:02:58.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Is there time?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.09,0:03:00.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm... we'll try our best.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.27,0:03:16.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You there! Are you here as warriors?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.11,0:03:17.57,Default,,0,0,0,,No, we're...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.57,0:03:19.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Then why are you here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.32,0:03:22.49,Default,,0,0,0,,We're... You see, we just want...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.49,0:03:25.24,Default,,0,0,0,,We want you to make up with Seiji.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.24,0:03:29.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Your little quarrel is\Nbothering everyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.12,0:03:30.54,Default,,0,0,0,,In this world,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.54,0:03:33.71,Default,,0,0,0,,there is only the duel\Nbetween me and my brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.71,0:03:36.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Whew, we made it in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.17,0:03:39.71,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't want to get\Ncaught in the middle of it,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.71,0:03:42.59,Default,,0,0,0,,then leave this world!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.09,0:03:45.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.72,0:03:47.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, what do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.52,0:03:53.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you this is what would happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.64,0:03:58.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Your twin brother is quite, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.40,0:04:00.23,Default,,0,0,0,,...grouchy, isn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.23,0:04:04.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Unlike me, he's really narrow minded.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.03,0:04:08.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, is it true that the cause of your\Nfighting is a single strand of hair?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.20,0:04:09.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.28,0:04:13.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I have 110,635 hairs,\Nwhile Sou has 110,634!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.58,0:04:16.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I have one more hair than he does.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.58,0:04:18.75,Default,,0,0,0,,We've counted a million times,\Nso there's no mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.17,0:04:21.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Talk about wigging out over nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.42,0:04:23.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Heh, I think so, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.63,0:04:26.80,Default,,0,0,0,,If he would just be honest about me\Nbeating him, this would all be over.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.80,0:04:30.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Still, Nagara and Mizuho,\Nthanks for coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.93,0:04:33.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I was right to talk to Nozomi about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.73,0:04:35.23,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll do whatever we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.23,0:04:36.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.43,0:04:38.73,Default,,0,0,0,,We got caught up in this\Nand didn't know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.73,0:04:40.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Ms. Aki has gone off\Nsomewhere else, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.99,0:04:46.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? What's that look for?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.32,0:04:49.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing. I was just wondering how\Nlong you were going to keep that up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.20,0:04:52.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, cram it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.00,0:05:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,How mature is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.62,0:05:01.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.30,0:05:12.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Gah! Repulsive bunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.81,0:05:14.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Every last one of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.60,0:05:19.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Poor fellow. He goes off in a huff\Nand sulks when he feels snubbed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.31,0:05:24.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll wager he got shot down by Nozomi.\NHe can't win her heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.32,0:05:25.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Harsh, but accurate.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.86,0:05:31.20,Default,,0,0,0,,If we're going to change the world,\Nwe need the power those twins have.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.20,0:05:32.20,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.20,0:05:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,...we only need one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.37,0:05:37.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Dosukoi!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.45,0:05:40.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Wrong! Watch me do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.88,0:05:43.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Dosukoi!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.96,0:05:46.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Private Kaga, you try it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.93,0:05:50.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Dosukoi!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.52,0:05:59.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, you! This is a\Ndamn fine piece of meat!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.85,0:06:01.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did you get it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.65,0:06:05.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I-It was given to me by Seiji! {\i1}Gottsuan!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.24,0:06:08.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you "{\i1}gottsuan{\i0}" me, you moron!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.65,0:06:11.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought I told you not\Nto get too close to him!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.28,0:06:12.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Gottsuan{\i0}—
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.16,0:06:12.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Why...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.99,0:06:16.24,Default,,0,0,0,,...can't you keep your promises?! Why?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.24,0:06:21.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Those two twins really are fighting each\Nother over a single strand of hair, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.92,0:06:25.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm, that's what he said.\NWait, you're not thinking...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.80,0:06:30.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. That's what I'm thinking.\NWe pluck a hair off the one who has more,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.18,0:06:31.51,Default,,0,0,0,,and show it to both of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.51,0:06:33.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think it will really be that easy?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.68,0:06:34.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.60,0:06:36.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you think of a better way?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.77,0:06:39.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm... How about a hair transplant?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.77,0:06:45.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It seemed like there was a power\Nholdover for this sort of thing...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.78,0:06:58.37,Default,,0,0,0,,W-Was that...?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.37,0:07:01.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm, "Reverse."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.92,0:07:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,How should we compete this time around?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.80,0:07:14.97,Default,,0,0,0,,"Reverse," the power the twins possess,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.97,0:07:18.76,Default,,0,0,0,,is able to rewind everything,\Nand reset the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.76,0:07:22.77,Default,,0,0,0,,It was suggested that if that happened,\Nthen those of us in stasis
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.77,0:07:26.27,Default,,0,0,0,,could possibly return to\Njust before we went adrift.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.86,0:07:28.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It was suggested?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.40,0:07:31.28,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the bottom of a giant crater.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.28,0:07:34.03,Default,,0,0,0,,This place could have been reset\Nany number of times already.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.53,0:07:38.49,Default,,0,0,0,,But, since it's a reset,\Nthe twins don't seem to remember it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.49,0:07:40.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess they wouldn't, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.03,0:07:44.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Moreover, since both\Ntwins can use "Reverse,"
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.38,0:07:46.42,Default,,0,0,0,,even if one of them uses "Reverse,"
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.42,0:07:48.42,Default,,0,0,0,,if the other one uses "Reverse" too,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.42,0:07:51.05,Default,,0,0,0,,then that rewinding gets\Nrewound back to the way it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.05,0:07:53.72,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's how these two twins' conflict\Nhas gone on for thousands of years.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.72,0:07:56.35,Default,,0,0,0,,They call it a "Reverse-Reverse."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.35,0:08:00.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but it's not just Sou and Seiji\Nworking their powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.39,0:08:04.89,Default,,0,0,0,,There's also the duel that's always being\Ncarried on when their power activates.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.52,0:08:06.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Duel?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.15,0:08:08.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.18,0:08:44.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, that's amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.06,0:08:47.61,Default,,0,0,0,,So there are cheat-code powers\Nthat let you do resets, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.61,0:08:49.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm? What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.90,0:08:55.86,Default,,0,0,0,,"Sou Seiji"...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.82,0:09:00.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? You mean those two\Naren't twins after all?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.37,0:09:01.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Does this mean...?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.83,0:09:07.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you feel pathetic?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.08,0:09:09.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You keep losing to yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.54,0:09:12.33,Default,,0,0,0,,That guy isn't me! {\i1}I'm {\i0}me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.96,0:09:14.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you like some help?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.21,0:09:15.21,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.88,0:09:18.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You may have started out being the same,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.96,0:09:20.97,Default,,0,0,0,,but you're different now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.56,0:09:24.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll beat him on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.35,0:09:27.47,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a believer, too, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.11,0:09:35.49,Default,,0,0,0,,This is God's divine protection.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.45,0:09:42.33,Default,,0,0,0,,They look like they're the same,\Nbut they aren't perfectly similar.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.33,0:09:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,There are slight variations in each copy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.20,0:09:46.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep it to yourself, dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.37,0:09:47.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.75,0:09:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you been listening in the whole time?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.04,0:09:54.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, starting at some point.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.55,0:09:58.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It speaks pretty poorly of your\Ncharacter not to say anything until now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.34,0:10:00.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I could never find the\Nright moment to mention it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.60,0:10:06.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Nyamazon stuff is essentially\Na bunch of copies, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.14,0:10:08.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Why ask me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.01,0:10:13.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Why? Because you're the\None doing the copying, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.02,0:10:16.57,Default,,0,0,0,,You know what? I can appreciate you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.57,0:10:19.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You're unusually negative for a dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.41,0:10:22.53,Default,,0,0,0,,But more than anything,\Nyou're good to Mizuho.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.53,0:10:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,The reason we kept it to\Nourselves is for Mizuho's sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.62,0:10:30.04,Default,,0,0,0,,If this got out, she's the one\Nthe blame would fall on.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.37,0:10:33.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Then again, if this had gotten out,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.34,0:10:36.71,Default,,0,0,0,,they would have been able to go home\Nfor certain when they had the chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.71,0:10:39.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Back to the future they wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.23,0:10:43.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sure you kept it\Nto yourselves for {\i1}her {\i0}sake?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.23,0:10:45.59,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you insinuating?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.94,0:10:49.31,Default,,0,0,0,,That you're actually doing it\Nfor yourselves, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.31,0:10:50.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You're afraid that if you leave Mizuho—
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.90,0:10:55.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You're wrong. That girl\Ncan't get by without me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.45,0:10:59.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think that's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.20,0:11:08.79,Default,,0,0,0,,The first one who noticed was that boy\Nwho is unusually smart for a child.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.79,0:11:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,...fifty USB cables,\Nand a box of Sudakosan Taro.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.80,0:11:20.01,Default,,0,0,0,,A crowd-funded game I once\Nwrote for the PocketGame.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.01,0:11:21.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You {\i0}wrote? Badass.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.97,0:11:24.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm. What's more,\Nonly one was ever sold.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.97,0:11:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It became known as a legendary\None-of-a-kind game among the fans.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.64,0:11:32.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah? You Indians are something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.65,0:11:33.93,Default,,0,0,0,,So what kind of game is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.27,0:11:36.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a highly-insidious,\Nimpossibly-hard game.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.48,0:11:39.07,Default,,0,0,0,,The goal is to encounter\Na single predetermined tick
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.07,0:11:42.49,Default,,0,0,0,,out of trillions of possible classmates,\Nand have it declare its love for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.49,0:11:44.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a romantic simulation game.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.90,0:11:47.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, that sounds super-fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.07,0:11:50.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I worked extra-hard on\Nworking out the ticks' emotions.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.32,0:11:53.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyhow, I need it to refer to for\Nthis next world we're conquering.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.87,0:11:55.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.38,0:11:58.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure. Oh, but these are off-limits.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.30,0:12:00.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I've made a few orders of my own,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.59,0:12:02.84,Default,,0,0,0,,but those cats won't bring\Nme anything that's alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.84,0:12:06.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Aw, I was afraid of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.39,0:12:08.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for your business.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.41,0:12:28.49,Default,,0,0,0,,The only one of its kind in\Nthe world, and now there's...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.49,0:12:29.41,Default,,0,0,0,,...two of them...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.16,0:12:35.66,Default,,0,0,0,,We have been copied.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.66,0:12:44.17,Default,,0,0,0,,He knew that he did not fully\Nunderstand both his and Mizuho's powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.17,0:12:47.05,Default,,0,0,0,,So, what do you think I should do?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.48,0:12:50.18,Default,,0,0,0,,What is my power, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.18,0:12:57.43,Default,,0,0,0,,It was then that he chose a\Ndifferent subject to investigate.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.43,0:12:59.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you all copies, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.74,0:13:04.95,Default,,0,0,0,,It's likely that the nature of\N"Nyamazon," Mizuho's power, is copying.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.95,0:13:06.49,Default,,0,0,0,,But if that's the case...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.57,0:13:09.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Those cats can't bring living creatures.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.32,0:13:12.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't add up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.67,0:13:17.33,Default,,0,0,0,,He was definitely close to\Nthe truth about going adrift.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.33,0:13:19.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Mizuho, can I borrow your cat?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.96,0:13:21.96,Default,,0,0,0,,There's something I want to investigate.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.34,0:13:23.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.34,0:13:25.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, hey...!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.76,0:13:27.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.22,0:13:35.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You are a cat. Your name is Tora.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.49,0:13:39.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you the one who coughed up a\Nhairball on my keyboard two days ago?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.41,0:13:45.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Good. Okay, next question.\NThis one has to do...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.48,0:13:48.49,Default,,0,0,0,,...with how you typically\Nbring us the things you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.29,0:13:52.36,Default,,0,0,0,,The things you bring back with you...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.36,0:13:54.87,Default,,0,0,0,,...are copies from the world\Nwe're from, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.01,0:13:57.37,Default,,0,0,0,,If you answer me, I'll give you this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.25,0:14:02.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Good boy. Next question.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.50,0:14:06.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys are lying to us, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.13,0:14:10.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You really can bring back\Nliving creatures, can't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.76,0:14:13.47,Default,,0,0,0,,You've been keeping that from us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.47,0:14:17.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Because if people found out, it would\Nput Mizuho in a precarious spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.01,0:14:24.40,Default,,0,0,0,,So that's it, then. The reason we went\Nadrift is because Mizuho's power—
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.40,0:14:28.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Wah! Hey, what are you doing?! Ah, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.08,0:14:36.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I was terrified that he\Nwould announce it to everyone,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.70,0:14:40.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(770,0)}but instead, he went off on his\Nsolo journey without saying a word.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.04,0:14:43.38,Default,,0,0,0,,He has a fine character,\Nfor being so hairless.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.38,0:14:46.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, it's not as though Mizuho\Nwas the only cause of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.92,0:14:52.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Going adrift was nothing that could be\Nstopped. He was well aware of that fact.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.68,0:14:57.93,Default,,0,0,0,,When we gave him those sea monkeys\Nas a going-away present,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.93,0:15:00.68,Default,,0,0,0,,he seemed to be quite delighted.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.06,0:15:11.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish I could go back home.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.83,0:15:13.69,Default,,0,0,0,,How is it possible...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.69,0:15:17.20,Default,,0,0,0,,...that things have changed so much\Nover a single strand of hair?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.88,0:15:25.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Not a very tasty-looking animal.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.14,0:15:27.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Then again,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.08,0:15:32.09,Default,,0,0,0,,is it even possible that two copies were\Nmade of someone from our own world?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.09,0:15:35.93,Default,,0,0,0,,That kind of sounds like\Nsomeone screwed up their order, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.93,0:15:40.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Could it be that two copies just\Nhappened to be made by accident?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.11,0:15:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Once they bring Kaga back,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.10,0:15:47.23,Default,,0,0,0,,we'll have all of us together.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.23,0:15:50.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Once we are, I wonder if we could\Nget you to take us to another world.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.57,0:15:51.27,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.74,0:15:55.15,Default,,0,0,0,,We aren't leaving here\Nuntil Ms. Aki returns.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.08,0:15:57.15,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.15,0:16:02.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't go thinking that there's a place\Nfor people like you anywhere you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.68,0:16:10.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me, when you say a "place,"\Nare you talking about this child's room
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.26,0:16:11.67,Default,,0,0,0,,that you recreated from your own home?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.18,0:16:15.67,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't have a power,\Nyou can't live on your own, can you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.67,0:16:18.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone has to be there to help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.18,0:16:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right. I may have been able\Nto survive in this world thanks to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.89,0:16:25.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Then do as I tell you to.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.81,0:16:28.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Then again, even so,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.32,0:16:32.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll thank you to let me\Npick my place for myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.11,0:16:34.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't do anything by yourself, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.49,0:16:39.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Admit it already. You're excess\Nbaggage for everyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.37,0:16:41.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Just because you have your lofty opinions
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.33,0:16:44.21,Default,,0,0,0,,doesn't mean you can change anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.18,0:16:49.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Nozomi!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.50,0:16:51.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave her to herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.47,0:16:54.71,Default,,0,0,0,,She's just going to keep\Nslowing everyone else down.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.97,0:16:57.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you really mean that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.30,0:16:58.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It would be...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.73,0:17:01.22,Default,,0,0,0,,...better if she didn't go with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.69,0:17:04.60,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not something that\Nyou get to decide, Asakaze.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.60,0:17:06.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It's something for Nozomi to decide.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.86,0:17:15.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay away from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.36,0:17:19.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not very good company right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.33,0:17:22.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm wondering if someone would\Nput an end to all of this for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.34,0:17:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,The truth is, those kinds of slippery\Nthoughts are all I've been thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.63,0:17:46.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I recognize this bear. It's the kind\Nthey give you to celebrate a birth.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.69,0:17:48.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I had one at my place, too,\Nbut I threw it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.99,0:17:51.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you suppose that was?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.52,0:17:54.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Because the cats came to live with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.07,0:17:58.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Cats are nice and warm,\Nbut bears are cold. 'Cause they're dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.04,0:18:01.15,Default,,0,0,0,,You can talk to them,\Nbut they never respond,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.15,0:18:05.41,Default,,0,0,0,,and the consistency of their fur is\Ndifferent. You know, 'cause they're dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.12,0:18:10.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, well, I... threw mine away, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.31,0:18:22.42,Default,,0,0,0,,When night comes, she can't\Neven go up the stairs by herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.23,0:18:26.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll bet that right now,\Nshe's trembling in fear from the storm.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.21,0:18:33.94,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't live with her\Nin that house anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.41,0:18:37.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I know that we're going\Nto end up getting split up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.20,0:18:43.95,Default,,0,0,0,,She's just a child.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.42,0:18:47.58,Default,,0,0,0,,She's still just a little—
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.31,0:19:00.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I've always wondered...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.82,0:19:03.80,Default,,0,0,0,,...what is the point of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.77,0:19:07.93,Default,,0,0,0,,What can you do with that toy?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.61,0:19:11.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Just how far have you fallen?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.02,0:19:16.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Ever since that day, when another me\Nstarted walking around on his own,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.03,0:19:18.94,Default,,0,0,0,,it has been my only wish\Nto do away with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.94,0:19:23.94,Default,,0,0,0,,That's more than you can handle.\NYou and I both have the same power.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.94,0:19:28.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You do actually understand, don't you?\NThat Seiji can't win?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.84,0:19:30.70,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why you pray.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.30,0:19:33.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.09,0:19:36.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Catch!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.30,0:19:37.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Today, we fight with these!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.42,0:19:43.89,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it. Always reaching the\Nsame outcome must be dull, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.87,0:20:05.86,Default,,0,0,0,,These are special guns.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.21,0:20:12.87,Default,,0,0,0,,This is what's called a "Skip."
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.80,0:20:22.13,Default,,0,0,0,,At last, my wish has come true.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.10,0:20:29.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Sakura!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.73,0:20:35.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop! That's my sacrifice to God!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.69,0:20:43.36,Default,,0,0,0,,This cat is still alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.53,0:20:48.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing ever changes if you\Nkeep clinging to somebody!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.20,0:20:51.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You just have to deal\Nwith things yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.26,0:21:08.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too cold out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.15,0:21:19.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I did manage to change, thanks to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.27,0:21:25.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Because you showed me the light.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.91,0:21:34.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go back.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.87,0:21:36.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.83,0:21:39.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.41,0:21:42.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You win. How does it feel,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.17,0:21:44.17,Default,,0,0,0,,now that you're the victor?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.80,0:21:47.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, somehow...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.01,0:21:50.05,Default,,0,0,0,,...it feels awfully hollow.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.05,0:21:51.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.06,0:21:55.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Because now, I don't know...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.80,0:21:58.27,Default,,0,0,0,,...what I should do.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.44,0:22:05.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, they're back.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.08,0:22:11.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the medicine I ordered for Sakura.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.45,0:22:17.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm? Say, what is she\Nalways doing, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.25,0:22:20.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Sakura is a born lazybones.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.95,0:22:25.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm, she seems like the smartest one, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.09,0:22:27.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to get going.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.80,0:22:32.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? What fun is it to go\Ntogether with those guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.97,0:22:36.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you may be right, but still...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.82,0:22:38.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.85,0:22:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Nozomi, I'll be in touch.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.90,0:22:42.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.44,0:22:45.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Bye-bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.04,0:22:58.01,Default,,0,0,0,,All that remains is a gaping hole, huh?

